          "text": "The radius is positive because squaring negative coordinates under the radical always yields a positive sum: $r = \\sqrt{(-24)^2 + (-7)^2} = \\sqrt{576 + 49} = 25$. As a distance, $r$ is a scalar and is always positive.",
